# abysm: upstream tests (tests/parity/upstream_abysm_*/) that tests/flows/test_upstream.py
# does not run against the ported flow, one per line: <test id>  <why>. Every other test of the
# app's own suite runs unchanged against store_release/flows/abysm/.
